# The build context is this directory. It should hold three small things: the
# Dockerfile, bin/, and the server-files profile staged into pack/.
#
# Nothing large belongs here. In particular the operator's own copy of the
# server files goes in ../client-archive and is mounted at run time, never
# baked into the image -- a 1.4 GB build context would be copied to the Docker
# daemon on every build, and the file is not ours to redistribute.
*.rar
*.zip
*.7z
